"faq-a\">A plan makes sure furniture fits the rooms, matches the style and leaves enough space to move around.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n        <!-- /FAQS:auto -->\n\n        <!-- CLOSING SECTION -->\n        <div class=\"closing-section\">\n            <h2>A Home Where Everyone Belongs</h2>\n            <p>The best homes give each person space and still bring the family together. Careful residential interior design makes that balance possible.</p><p>Planning a home in Pitampura? <a href=\"/pitampura/contact\">Invite 9th Corner over for a chat</a>.</p>\n        </div>\n\n    </div>\n"}